    <string name="onb_accept">I understand</string>
    <string name="disclaimer">MioIBAN is a local archive provided "as is", without any warranty.\n\n• It does not send payments, manage deadlines or send notifications.\n• It does not sync anything and has no server: data stays ONLY on this device.\n• It is not encrypted: anyone using this device can see the saved IBANs.\n• The backup is the user\'s sole responsibility. If you lose the device or clear the data without exporting a backup, the data is lost and cannot be recovered.\n• MioIBAN checks the formal correctness of an IBAN (length and check digits), but cannot guarantee that it matches a real account. Always confirm with your bank before a payment.</string>

